<%#Import the header%>
<%- include('../templates/header'); -%>
<%#/Import the header%>

<section class="fanfiction">
<div class="fanfiction-container">
  <div class="fanfiction-masthead">
    <h1>Archives</h1>
  </div>

  <section class="fanfiction-hero">
    <div>
      <h2>The Archives</h2>
      <p class="fanfiction-hero-text">Do you want all of your favourite Harry and Hermione fanfiction brought together into one place? Our archives are the place to be, a true tale of the history of the fandom, and forgotten gems that you might have lost track of along the way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>



  <section class="fanfiction-body-content">
    <div class="fanfiction-section-label">Portkey.org</div>
    <div class="fanfiction-body-text">
      <p>Perhaps you've forgotten what the past felt like? Portkey was one of the most beloved Harry and Hermione breeding grounds back in the day, a time when the Harry Potter fandom was at its peak, and when the internet was a better place.</p>
      <p>A web developer far better than me has managed to keep an unofficial website live, that is still readable and searchable.</p>
      <a href="https://portkey-archive.org/" class="btn btn-sm w-25 btn-primary">View Portkey Archive</a>
    </div>
    <div class="fanfiction-grid-image">
      <img src="/images/fanfictionpage/portkey.jpg" alt="Grid image 1">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fanfiction-quote-section">
    <blockquote>
      "Perfection is achieved not when there is nothing more to add, but when there is nothing left to take away."
    </blockquote>
    <p class="fanfiction-quote-attribution">— Antoine de Saint-Exupéry</p>
  </section>

  <section class="fanfiction-two-column">
    <div class="fanfiction-section-label">Practice</div>
    <div class="fanfiction-columns">
      <div class="fanfiction-column-text">
        <p>Implementing these principles requires discipline and confidence. The designer must resist the urge to fill every available space, trusting that emptiness serves a purpose beyond mere aesthetics.</p>
        <p>Consider the page spread: generous margins frame the content, line spacing allows text to breathe, paragraph breaks create natural pauses. Each decision about spacing influences how readers engage with information.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fanfiction-column-text">
        <p>Digital interfaces present unique challenges. Screen real estate feels precious, stakeholders request more features, analytics drive density. Yet the most successful platforms maintain spatial generosity.</p>
        <p>The lesson remains consistent across media: clarity emerges from selective focus, enhanced by the strategic use of nothing at all.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fanfiction-image-grid">
    <div class="fanfiction-grid-image">
      <img src="https://assets.codepen.io/406785/augustine-wong-oebTM5wHTfw-unsplash.jpg" alt="Grid image 1">
    </div>
    <div class="fanfiction-grid-image">
      <img src="https://assets.codepen.io/406785/h-co-3oOR7B2inwc-unsplash.jpg" alt="Grid image 2">
    </div>
    <div class="fanfiction-grid-image">
      <img src="https://assets.codepen.io/406785/bharath-kumar-rqIyJozwdTc-unsplash.jpg" alt="Grid image 3">
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="fanfiction-footer">
    <p>Archives Page</p>
    <p>Harry and Hermione</p>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

